      "title": "Free functions — not class members",
      "items": [
        "lbm::runtime::prepare_single_level(program) -> SingleLevelPreparationResult<...>",
        "On success, std::move(result).take() transfers the opaque PreparedSingleLevelRun token.",
        "lbm::runtime::run_single_level(prepared) consumes that token and returns SingleLevelRunReport.",
        "SingleLevelProgram is a factory input; it is not retained as another runtime state owner."
      ]
