    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Runtime behavior",
      "items": [
        "The run function sequences collision, pre-stream boundary work, streaming, reconstruction and observations.",
        "RunSession is supplied by the case. Its start / observationPlan / observeInitialized / observeCompleted / observeFinal / writePerformance hooks are a compile-time contract.",
        "Published views borrow fields; callers must not retain their references after the callback.",
        "PreparedRun abbreviates PreparedSingleLevelRun<...>; Field abbreviates LatticeField<D>. Selected signatures omit overloads and qualifiers."
      ]
